Agent guidance for this repository is maintained in `AGENTS.md` at the repository
root — follow it. In short: `tl-ratify` is a human's cockpit for ratifying
machine-proposed items — **if you are the agent, propose and hand off; never
ratify on a human's behalf and never invent a `--by` name.**
